cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Latent Fovea in your work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Latent Fovea"
abstract: >-
  An open-source browser tool for exploring the real latent space of
  open-weights language models, foveated like a VR headset: the vectors under
  your gaze are streamed in, re-projected and searched in WebAssembly, and the
  rest is drawn from a small precomputed atlas. It includes GPT-2's forward
  pass slowed down, masked diffusion (MDLM), models loaded from Hugging Face,
  and GLM-5.2 (744B mixture of experts) run on WebGPU with its experts
  streamed from an SSD.
authors:
  - name: "Recourse Software Inc."
    website: "https://knowdrive.ai"
    email: "joel@recoursellm.com"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Recourse-Software-Inc/latent-fovea"
url: "https://latent.knowdrive.ai"
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.1.1
date-released: 2026-10-16
keywords:
  - interpretability
  - latent space
  - visualization
  - webgpu
  - webassembly
  - mixture of experts
  - large language models
